Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.39,OP-ja,,0,0,0,beretag!op1,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3a33}運命共同体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.39,OP-zh,,0,0,0,beretag!op1,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3a33}我們是命運的共同體
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:50.60,OP-ja,,0,0,0,beretag!op1,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3a33\c&H6B463F&}世界中の記憶がいつか
