Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:04.62,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}窓際の席で移ろう気持ちの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:04.62,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}坐在窗邊的座位上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,0,590,260,,{\an9\fs40\blur4\3a55}校對
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,1385,0,260,,{\blur4\3a55}toirin\N思慕雪的熱帶魚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,0,590,400,,{\an9\fs40\blur4\3a55}時軸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,1385,0,400,,{\blur4\3a55}Carters\N納莉のSakura
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,0,590,555,,{\an9\fs40\blur4\3a55}後期
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,1385,0,555,,{\blur4\3a55}芸\Nop200
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,0,590,710,,{\an9\fs40\blur4\3a55}壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.55,staff,,1385,0,710,,{\blur4\3a55}op200
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:06.92,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}置き場を探している
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:06.92,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}為紛亂的心情尋覓安放之處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:12.83,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}悲しみに覆われないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:12.83,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}只為不再被悲傷淹沒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:18.91,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}訳もわからず時を忘れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:18.91,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}不知不覺間忘卻了時間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.91,0:22:21.46,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}おどけて笑い合った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.91,0:22:21.46,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}我們嬉鬧著笑作一團
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:27.47,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}それが ありふれた群像だとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:27.47,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}雖說這畫面再平常不過
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:30.00,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}そんな日々を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:30.00,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}但我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.58,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}もう１回もう１回なんて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.58,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}昔日不能重現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:36.80,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}叶わないってわかってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:36.80,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}往事不會再來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:40.66,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}真昼の空の月のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:40.66,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}徜若能像正午天空的月亮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:44.26,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}強く美しくいられたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:44.26,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}一樣堅強美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.74,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}あの日の過ちも後悔も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.74,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}那天的過錯與遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:51.34,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}全部綺麗に許せたかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:51.34,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}是否能被徹底寬恕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.87,0:22:54.73,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}大事なことはいつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.87,0:22:54.73,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}什麼東西值得珍重
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:58.92,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}過ぎ去ってからようやく気が付くんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:58.92,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}總在失去之後才懂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:02.54,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}真昼の空の月に向かって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:02.54,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}伸手向那正午天空的月亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:07.11,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}手を伸ばしたって触れないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:07.11,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33}哪怕無法觸及
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.11,0:23:11.67,ED-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}忘れはしない愛しい日々よ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.11,0:23:11.67,ED-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur4\3a33\3c&HEFAF0E&}美好的時光也將永駐我心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:28.05,zh,,0,0,0,,你們究竟是什麼人\N{\rja}をじめら一体何者だ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:31.20,zh,,0,0,0,,我們是便利屋68\N{\rja}私たちはベリア68
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:34.06,zh,,0,0,0,,只要給錢什麼都可以做\N{\rja}金さえもらえれば何でもする
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:36.84,zh,,0,0,0,,萬事屋哦\N{\rja}何でもやよ
